        "The three native selectors return TPlyCharData pointers, including the original check for a valid secondary-card entry. The record stays 0x41C bytes with appearance at 0x370.",
        "The real selector is 0x60 bytes. Offset 0x24 is read and written as scene state, including the state copied at the end of task dispatch.",
        "The extra model, BML and timer fields belong to the separately allocated 0x78-byte TChCrLoadGmNjReq. The native class shares the model-list terminator with the empty motion list.",
        "The time-setting, request and release declarations use their active owners. The existing OS-context, modem and signed-result signatures account for the other historical changes."
      ]
